  "tos_note": "Operator-approved PostHog Cloud organization only. Render posthog_region as us or eu so the base URL is https://us.posthog.com/api or https://eu.posthog.com/api, then render organization_id, project_id, filters, and linked fixture identifiers before live capture. Datalox live capture is GET-only. PostHog's general query execution endpoint is POST-based read access and is intentionally omitted; only the officially documented GET retrieval route for an existing query_id is listed as a fixture expansion. Batch exports and Hog functions cover verified GET-readable data-pipeline and destination configuration surfaces; no unverified destination route is included."
